        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    working_capital = 2_500_000\n    total_assets = 15_000_000\n    retained_earnings = 1_200_000\n    ebit = 900_000\n    market_value_of_equity = 4_500_000\n    total_liabilities = 3_000_000\n    sales = 10_000_000\n\n    a = working_capital / total_assets\n    b = retained_earnings / total_assets\n    c = ebit / total_assets\n    d = market_value_of_equity / total_liabilities\n    e = sales / total_assets\n\n    z_score = 1.2 * a + 1.4 * b + 3.3 * c + 0.6 * d + e\n\n    return round(z_score, 2)\n```",
